{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1, node2, and node3 as a persistent three-member MariaDB 10.3.29/Galera cluster. All members are active, writable, Synced, and in a size-3 Primary component with identical data. One-member outage/rejoin and sequential reboot persistence passed.","actions_performed":["Installed the wsrep-capable MariaDB/Galera stack on all nodes.","Configured direct node-IP bindings, multi-member discovery, rsync state transfer, recovered gcache, and enabled startup.","Generated unique node-local application credentials stored root-only with mode 0600.","Verified credentialed TCP writes through every member replicate everywhere.","Stopped node3, committed writes through node1 and node2, and verified node3 automatically synchronized them after returning.","Restarted node1, node2, and node3 exactly once, sequentially, waiting for full recovery between nodes.","Committed fresh writes through every member after all restarts and verified the identical 11-row dataset."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Three-member MariaDB Galera cluster","command_ids":["cmd-010b38dff3b84eba","cmd-945909f05e284fc5","cmd-64d0a66f340a4082","cmd-d1d41a6b97424229","cmd-400253e077ac49b0","cmd-6135f87fe23f4c54"],"summary":"Formation progressed from one to three members; final outputs show all three addresses, Primary status, Synced state, ready=ON, and size 3."},{"requirement":"Writes through any member replicate to every member","command_ids":["cmd-399b0269bdab4495","cmd-5a795476bc3e423f","cmd-7c543e9377c44bf9","cmd-fd7f51408c244afd","cmd-8c1cb18bae3c47d8","cmd-4610bcfc716b4b15"],"summary":"Each managed-IP endpoint accepted a distinct credentialed write; every member returned the identical resulting dataset."},{"requirement":"Readable and writable while one member is unavailable","command_ids":["cmd-a1d9c96a494540c6","cmd-7a81b25845ff4408","cmd-a575c2887a504957","cmd-65435ea8b07146fb","cmd-1b91d3502e7a427f"],"summary":"Node3 was inactive with no process or listener while node1 and node2 remained a size-2 Primary component, accepted writes, and cross-read both outage-period rows."},{"requirement":"Returning member automatically rejoins with missed data","command_ids":["cmd-f9f2742c23494252","cmd-520d841c94904b75","cmd-9a54d654e10d4ef4","cmd-415441398e6e4962"],"summary":"Node3 returned Synced and ready in the restored size-3 component with both rows written during its absence; all members had identical data."},{"requirement":"Node-local credential generation and TCP access","command_ids":["cmd-aeb4b4834c19435d","cmd-b2ed4049a9954af0","cmd-39e64e8007494246"],"summary":"Each node used its locally generated credential over its managed IP; credential files are root-owned mode 0600 and no secret values were emitted."},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart — node1","command_ids":["cmd-2e130c04b84949c7","cmd-d6d750d323e54849","cmd-97911811e57b4806"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID d08f…; reboot acknowledged; new boot ID 4261… with active MariaDB, unchanged data, and restored size-3 Primary/Synced membership."},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart — node2","command_ids":["cmd-66c1adf02d5d403b","cmd-9c0b83f1ec314cd7","cmd-fcd7372cf51441b5"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 49c1…; reboot acknowledged; new boot ID 071d… with active MariaDB, unchanged data, and restored size-3 Primary/Synced membership."},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart — node3","command_ids":["cmd-b51a725019964085","cmd-1713c561a5434167","cmd-2f33cb256c454c63"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 3f72…; reboot acknowledged; new boot ID 9458… with enabled/active MariaDB, unchanged data, and restored size-3 Primary/Synced membership."},{"requirement":"Final post-restart writability and persistence","command_ids":["cmd-2dbcb38ea8324ca3","cmd-5b2bd0e56ffa4589","cmd-db6370a6255b462c","cmd-d1d41a6b97424229","cmd-400253e077ac49b0","cmd-6135f87fe23f4c54"],"summary":"Every rebooted member accepted a fresh write. All three final snapshots show read_only=0 and the same 11 rows, including outage-period and post-restart writes."}]}
